Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 22:50:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Your fists in the fight, two exhales at the end, no jump
 after the letter, the next chapter compiled ahead

- Your arms throw the blows in front of you under the blur (your side of the animation, only the
  arms drawn, dark sleeves, hands in fists); fists fixed for both men (the thumb folds in).
- The exhales only on the last two blows, as far apart as in the recordings, the second on the
  uppercut; the flurry keeps its hits.
- The aftermath frame and episode 3's first frame are the same, so going on after the invitation
  no longer throws you to the side.
- Prewarm: the next world's shaders are compiled while the current one plays, with its own lights
  (the loading veil's compile mixed every world's lights, so the turn into the city recompiled
  everything); the ink buffer is one pass instead of three. Lighter blur so the arms read.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017Yfam9H7FbQFsBx6yJZ8yW
